# Survey conducted on Saturday 13th May 1995, OUCC
# Survey grade 5 claimed by the surveyors.
# Surveyed by: Steve Roberts, Chris Densham
# Data entry: Ali Garman, Tim Long

survey breadfruit

# Station Equivalences

# Data ordering

# Specify units of measurement

